      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\int \\frac{6{x}^{2}-8}{2x}\\,dx.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Applying the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{6{x}^{2}-8}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{6{x}^{2}}{2x}-\\frac{4}{x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (3x-\\frac{4}{x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int x\\,\\text{d}x-4\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{2}-4\\ln|x|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
